{
    "title": "CASH BUDDY - Play & Earn Money",
    "description": "Earn free gift cards and money by playing free games. It\u2019s time to use CASH BUDDY and become the boss \ud83d\udc51 Don\u2019t miss this amazing chance!\r\n\r\nJoin the #1 highest-paying app! Earn up to $300 with a single offer. With CASH BUDDY you are on the forefront of making money online!\r\n\r\nOnce you earn enough money to cash out on the app with play to earn games, select money or gift card rewards, cash out, & we'll send an email! Earn for Listening to free Music. Cash & Money Rewards Paid In Gift cards for playing games or play-to-earn Radio! Make Money with new mobile games, Get Paid Real Cash or gift cards for listening to music! Get Paid Real Cash Money for play to earn surveys, play to earn cash competitions, & playing real money cash games! \r\nChoose your games and start directly \ud83c\udfae\r\nReceive rewards for every minute you spend playing free games \ud83c\udf81\ud83c\udf89\ud83c\udfc6Easy right?\r\nThe app is the only place for Free Music, Free Games, Savings, & Gift Cards! Stack cash app rewards by listening to our free music player while you get paid to play games!\r\n\r\nMake better use of your time, continue playing you games you enjoy playing anyways & get paid at the same time \ud83d\udcb0\r\n\r\nInstall CASH BUDDY for free (no deposits, no in-app purchases, and, no ads at all) \u2705\r\n\r\nAre you looking for a cash app that pays you for real?\r\n\u2192 Start playing games that give you free money! \ud83e\udd11\r\n\r\nCASH BUDDY is a completely free app, offering you the opportunity to earn real money by playing free games on your mobile phone. Fast & easy \ud83c\udf81\r\n\r\nDiscover and play new and popular games every day from our list \u27a1 spend time playing free games, collect coins \u27a1 exchange coins and win cash prizes such as free Amazon gift cards, Google Play voucher, PSN cards, Steam coupons, or you can simply cash out, transferring free money directly to your PayPal account.\r\n\r\nPlaying free games and making money sounds exciting, right? Now, let\u2019s get to the point.\r\n\r\nHow to start making money with our reward app?\r\n\r\nCASH BUDDY is so easy to use:\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae Play any of our FREE partner games\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Get CASH BUDDY now for FREE\r\n\ud83d\udc8e Earn coins for every second you play\r\n\u23f0 The more you play the more money you\u2019ll make\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Receive ANY gift card or real money reward you want\r\n\r\nJust as easy as that.\r\n\r\nWhy CASH BUDDY?\r\n\r\n\u2714\ufe0fHigher rewards than any other app in the world\r\n\u2714\ufe0fCompletely free cash app (\u26d4no deposits, \u26d4no in-app purchases, \u26d4no ads)!\r\n\u2714\ufe0fEasy & fast to use!\r\n\u2714\ufe0fFast and guaranteed payouts!\r\n\u2714\ufe0fHuge selection of different game types to fit any preference!\r\n\u2714\ufe0fInvite your friends to CASH BUDDY and get bonus rewards!\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019re reading this, you shouldn\u2019t waste this lucky day! Free games and free money in one app, without any ads.\r\n\r\nThe exciting thing about our app is that you can earn your first gift card or get your paypal money reward after just a few hours you spent playing any game you choose!\r\nCurrently, our offer wall contains various game types such as Casual, Strategy, Action, Puzzle, Adventure, Arcade, and many more. You can play ANY game you like and start earning cash!\r\n\r\nIf you already like playing mobile games, CASH BUDDY is the app for you as you will earn money playing games!\r\n\r\nWith CASH BUDDY you will never have to worry about your pocket money again!\r\n\r\nDo what you do anyways, but make money at the same time! \ud83c\udfc6",
